# Architecture

## Module map

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `server.ts` | Entry, guard, CLI, transport, `registerGscTools` |
| `tools/index.ts` | All MCP tool registration |
| `tools/schemas.ts` | Zod params |
| `tools/gsc*.ts` | Thin GSC API wrappers |
| `clients.ts` | `getGscClient` + test overrides |
| `errors.ts` | `sanitizeToolError`, `formatErrorForLog` |
| `output-format.ts` | `formatToolResult`, TOON/JSON tool payloads |
| `http-*.ts` | Optional HTTP; caps in `http-config.ts` |

## New tool checklist

1. Schema in **`schemas.ts`**
2. Wrapper in **`tools/gsc*.ts`** via **`getGscClient`**
3. Register in **`tools/index.ts`**
4. Mocked unit test; integration only with `GSC_INTEGRATION=1`

## Build

- **esbuild** → single **`dist/server.js`**; **`dependencies` external** (not bundled).
- Dynamic `import()` for MCP SDK and tools in `server.ts`.

## Red flags

| Stop | Why |
|------|-----|
| GSC calls in `server.ts` | Breaks mock boundary |
| Bundle dependencies | Conflicts with publish model |
| Tools outside `index.ts` | Discovery drift |
| New Google APIs / write scopes | Out of product scope |
